<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Banacci upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Banacci upped to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Mexican brokerage Valores Finamex raised its rating on financial group Banamex-Accival (Banacci) to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Rogelio Urrutia said he estimates that by year's end Banamex, the group's bank unit, will have asset quality similar to that of its competitors and rack up profits of 2.259 billion pesos.</p>
</text>
